    {
      "id": "SDKzDkATG1QefBwF1uVTb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3623.9961625522465,
      "y": -3658.0098009368585,
      "width": 192.71640287713964,
      "height": 134.3563598072041,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1484618183,
      "version": 1528,
      "versionNonce": 634890053,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794447401622,
      "created": 1793632100047,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这些是被 at，还未处理完的任\n务（关闭/不在计划/合并等等）\n\nBot 能通过工具实时列出任务清\n单（running + done + on-\nhold），检测到 github 已经被\n处理时，Bot 不会收到通知，但\n任务会自动被归类到 “Done”",
      "fontSize": 13.43563598072041,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这些是被 at，还未处理完的任务（关闭/不在计划/合并等等）\n\nBot 能通过工具实时列出任务清单（running + done + on-hold），检测到 github 已经被处理时，Bot 不会收到通知，但任务会自动被归类到 “Done”",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
